
# game/story.rpy:4334
translate spanish story_d6a49f8a:

    # "As we walk, Sayori speaks up again."
    "Mientras caminamos, Sayori vuelve a hablar."

# game/story.rpy:4336
translate spanish story_cc0cbfe0:

    # s "Are you sure you're feeling okay to go to school today? You still don't look well."
    s "¿Seguro de que te sientes bien para ir al instituto hoy? Sigues sin tener buena pinta."

# game/story.rpy:4338
translate spanish story_07b77173:

    # mc "Well, maybe Muramoto-san's cupcake cured me."
    mc "Bueno, quizás el cupcake de Muramoto-san me curó."

# game/story.rpy:4339
translate spanish story_99588da4:

    # "I joke a bit before getting serious."
    "Bromeo un poco antes de ponerme serio."

# game/story.rpy:4340
translate spanish story_7499baed:

    # mc "I'll be honest, I don't feel quite back to a hundred percent but I feel good enough to come to school."
    mc "Te seré sincero, no me siento al cien por cien recuperado, pero me siento lo bastante bien para ir al instituto."

# game/story.rpy:4341
translate spanish story_0b9fc774:

    # mc "Just don't expect me to do much today in the club."
    mc "No esperéis que haga mucho hoy en el club."

# game/story.rpy:4342
translate spanish story_4a9f7737:

    # s 2a "I don't think anyone will force you."
    s 2a "No creo que nadie te fuerce."

# game/story.rpy:4343
translate spanish story_028a95fd:

    # "More students join us on the road."
    "Más alumnos se nos unen por el camino."

# game/story.rpy:4348
translate spanish story_be4d8de8:

    # "As we approach the school, I see the students heading in...along with Kozue."
    "Al acercarnos al insti, veo a los alumnos entrando... y a Kozue."

# game/story.rpy:4353
translate spanish story_de080783:

    # "That's her?"
    "¿Esa es ella?"

# game/story.rpy:4357
translate spanish story_08473374:

    # "Wow, she's not a gyaru anymore."
    "Vaya, ya no es una gyaru."

# game/story.rpy:4359
translate spanish story_ef3b5e02:

    # "She locks eyes with me, and approaches."
    "Se queda mirándome fijamente y se acerca."

# game/story.rpy:4360
translate spanish story_61edbd1b:

    # "I step between her and Sayori."
    "Me interpongo entre ella y Sayori."

# game/story.rpy:4361
translate spanish story_623cfbf2:

    # mc "Go inside."
    mc "Entra."

# game/story.rpy:4363
translate spanish story_e61afb9d:

    # s "Don't do anything stupid."
    s "No hagas tonterías."

# game/story.rpy:4365
translate spanish story_ca8749a2:

    # mc "I promised you I wouldn't, remember? Now go."
    mc "Te prometí que no, ¿recuerdas? Ahora ve."

# game/story.rpy:4366
translate spanish story_d259368a:

    # "Sayori begins walking to the school."
    "Sayori empieza a caminar hacia el instituto."

# game/story.rpy:4368
translate spanish story_42240bb5:

    # k "Wait! I need to talk to both of you!"
    k "¡Espera! ¡Necesito hablar con ustedes!"

# game/story.rpy:4371
translate spanish story_b7c5c4aa:

    # mc "Whatever you have to say, it can wait until later."
    mc "Lo que sea que tengas que decir, puede esperar a más tarde."

# game/story.rpy:4373
translate spanish story_382c4c08:

    # k "I'm afraid it can't."
    k "Me temo que no."

# game/story.rpy:4375
translate spanish story_f3b5e8c4:

    # mc "Alright, what is it?"
    mc "Vale, ¿qué pasa?"

# game/story.rpy:4378
translate spanish story_682587cf:

    # k "I'm sorry to the both of you!"
    k "¡Os pido perdón a los dos!"

# game/story.rpy:4380
translate spanish story_af05e4b8:

    # "That was loud. We get a few stares."
    "Ha sonado fuerte. Algunos nos miran."

# game/story.rpy:4382
translate spanish story_0e1cdeaa:

    # s "I thought you said you weren't going to say anything to her about me?"
    s "¿No dijiste que no le dirías nada sobre mí?"

# game/story.rpy:4383
translate spanish story_f5e1fbbc:

    # "Sayori leans in and whispers that into my ear."
    "Sayori se acerca y me lo susurra al oído."

# game/story.rpy:4385
translate spanish story_ac373f14:

    # mc "I didn't."
    mc "No he dicho nada."

# game/story.rpy:4388
translate spanish story_31436392:

    # k "After...Monday, I went home and thought long and hard about what I'd done."
    k "Después del... lunes, volví a casa y lo pensé a fondo."

# game/story.rpy:4390
translate spanish story_57feb6e1:

    # k "I even talked to my parents about it. They told me the same thing you did."
    k "Hasta hablé con mis padres al respecto. Me dijeron lo mismo que vosotros."

# game/story.rpy:4392
translate spanish story_17acd72d:

    # k "I don't expect you to forgive me, but I just wanted you to know I won't be acting like that from now on."
    k "No espero que me perdonéis, pero solo quería que supierais que no volveré a actuar así."

# game/story.rpy:4395
translate spanish story_a352f6f1:

    # "Well, this is definitely not what I was expecting."
    "Bueno, esto desde luego no es lo que esperaba."

# game/story.rpy:4396
translate spanish story_9bf9afbc:

    # mc "Words are just words. Please prove your words with your actions."
    mc "Las palabras son solo palabras. Demuestra lo que dices con tus actos."

# game/story.rpy:4398
translate spanish story_3e24e157:

    # k "You have my word. I'll make it up to the two of you and everyone else."
    k "Tenéis mi palabra. Os compensaré a vosotros dos y a todo el mundo."

# game/story.rpy:4405
translate spanish story_92a0650f:

    # "She heads inside quickly."
    "Entra en el instituto deprisa."

# game/story.rpy:4406
translate spanish story_d410c681:

    # mc "Well, that was unexpected."
    mc "Vale, eso sí que ha sido inesperado."

# game/story.rpy:4408
translate spanish story_51bc94f0:

    # "I look over at Sayori and see that she's trembling."
    "Miro a Sayori y la veo temblar."

# game/story.rpy:4409
translate spanish story_04b993cf:

    # mc "Sayori?!"
    mc "¡¿Sayori?!"

# game/story.rpy:4415
translate spanish story_39c8cec6:

    # s 2l "Ehehe, sorry, I guess I wasn't prepared for that encounter today."
    s 2l "Je, je, perdona, supongo que no estaba preparada para el encontrón de hoy."

# game/story.rpy:4416
translate spanish story_53946efe:

    # mc "Come on, I'll walk you to your classroom."
    mc "Venga, te acompaño hasta tu aula."

# game/story.rpy:4425
translate spanish story_74dcc24c:

    # "I take her inside, staying close just in case she collapses."
    "La llevo dentro, quedándome cerca por si se desmaya."

# game/story.rpy:4426
translate spanish story_8e39d204:

    # "Meiji leads me to Sayori's classroom, which is right next to Meiji's."
    "Meiji me lleva al aula de Sayori, que está justo al lado del suyo."

# game/story.rpy:4433
translate spanish story_65f1a9d6:

    # s "Thanks, Meiji, I guess we really are better at taking care of each other than we are at taking care of ourselves."
    s "Gracias, Meiji. Supongo que de verdad somos mejores cuidándonos entre nosotros que cuidándonos a nosotros mismos."

# game/story.rpy:4434
translate spanish story_3269ee9a:

    # mc "I take care of you because I care about you."
    mc "Cuido de ti porque me importas."

# game/story.rpy:4435
translate spanish story_1f9c491d:

    # mc "I'll see you in the clubroom later. I can't wait to read your poem."
    mc "Nos vemos luego en la sala de club. No puedo esperar a leer tu poema."

# game/story.rpy:4436
translate spanish story_7d8e9027:

    # s 1x "Me too. Later, Meiji!"
    s 1x "Yo tampoco. ¡Hasta luego, Meiji!"

# game/story.rpy:4439
translate spanish story_296032c3:

    # "She sits in the second seat to the back next to the window."
    "Se sienta en la segunda fila desde el fondo, junto a la ventana."

# game/story.rpy:4445
translate spanish story_7e8f44cf:

    # mc "{b}She's got the protagonist window seat like us.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Tiene el sitio de ventanilla del protagonista, como nosotros.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4446
translate spanish story_14fe66fe_2:

    # cm "{i}What do you mean?{/i}"
    cm "{i}¿A qué te refieres?{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4447
translate spanish story_a77f4208:

    # mc "{b}You know how in school anime, the male protagonist has that back corner window seat? Like we do?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Sabes que en los animes de instituto el protagonista masculino siempre tiene ese sitio de la esquina de atrás, junto a la ventana? Como nosotros.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4448
translate spanish story_c93915a4:

    # cm "{i}Ooooh, I didn't even think of that.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Ahhh, no habia pensado en ello.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4449
translate spanish story_399cab5d:

    # mc "{b}Makes me wonder if the others have the same seats in their classroom?{/b}"
    mc "{b}Me da curiosidad saber si las otras tienen los mismos sitios en sus aulas.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4450
translate spanish story_482bf04c:

    # cm "{i}I wouldn't be surprised.{/i}"
    cm "{i}No me sorprendería.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4456
translate spanish story_9793720c:

    # "When I enter the classroom, a student approaches me."
    "Al entrar en el aula, una alumna se me acerca."

# game/story.rpy:4459
translate spanish story_bf5b38e0:

    # u "Chizu-san, are you feeling better today?"
    u "Chizu-san, ¿te sientes mejor hoy?"

# game/story.rpy:4460
translate spanish story_b1433ef0:

    # mc "{b}Who's that?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Quién es esta?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4461
translate spanish story_4176726b:

    # cm "{i}That's the class rep, Fujiwara Mori.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Es la delegada, Fujiwara Mori.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4462
translate spanish story_5c0a6f97:

    # mc "{b}Gotcha.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Vale.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4463
translate spanish story_27f4b17e:

    # mc "Ah, yes I am. It was just some food poisoning."
    mc "Ah, sí. Solo he tenido una intoxicación alimentaria."

# game/story.rpy:4464
translate spanish story_a31f45ed:

    # mc "I'm not feeling quite back to normal, but I can at least come to class no problem."
    mc "No me siento del todo bien todavía, pero al menos puedo venir a clase sin problema."

# game/story.rpy:4466
translate spanish story_26e5c706:

    # sk "Oh good. Did you want the notes from yesterday? I made copies for you and Tani-san."
    sk "Ah, qué bien. ¿Quieres los apuntes de ayer? He hecho copias para ti y para Tani-san."

# game/story.rpy:4468
translate spanish story_d7d5422c:

    # mc "Tani-san wasn't here either?"
    mc "¿Tani-san tampoco estaba?"

# game/story.rpy:4470
translate spanish story_4d06ce9a:

    # "Looking over I see Kozue sitting with her head on her desk, arms covering her face."
    "Al mirar, veo a Kozue sentada con la cabeza sobre el pupitre, con los brazos cubriéndole la cara."

# game/story.rpy:4471
translate spanish story_8e5a6db5:

    # sk "No, she wasn't."
    sk "No, no estaba."

# game/story.rpy:4473
translate spanish story_c844b58c:

    # sk "After your brutal takedown, she probably stayed home out of embarrassment."
    sk "Después de tu brutal derribo, probablemente se quedó en casa por vergüenza."

# game/story.rpy:4475
translate spanish story_659ccb9e:

    # mc "Yeah, I did go overboard, didn't I? I'm really sorry about that. I guess I just snapped."
    mc "Sí, me pasé de la raya... Lo siento mucho. Supongo que solo perdí los nervios."

# game/story.rpy:4477
translate spanish story_e6257eba:

    # sk "I don't blame you. No one here was willing to stand up for you."
    sk "No te lo reprocho. Nadie aquí quería defenderte."

# game/story.rpy:4479
translate spanish story_bdc63824:

    # sk "Even me, I'm ashamed to say..."
    sk "Incluso yo, y lo digo con vergüenza..."

# game/story.rpy:4480
translate spanish story_b955c26f:

    # cm "{i}She's one of the few people in class who's nice to me...and I haven't appreciated it...{/i}"
    cm "{i}Es de las pocas personas de la clase que es amable conmigo... y no la he valorado...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4481
translate spanish story_49263230:

    # "I feel his guilt again."
    "Siento de nuevo su culpa."

# game/story.rpy:4482
translate spanish story_962fa6b7:

    # cm "{i}I've been so distant...{/i}"
    cm "{i}He sido tan distante...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4484
translate spanish story_acf2ec54:

    # mc "With the way I've acted until now, I'm not surprised. I don't exactly exude a friendly attitude to my classmates, do I?"
    mc "Con mi forma de actuar hasta ahora, no me sorprende. No transmito precisamente una actitud amigable con mis compañeros, ¿verdad?"

# game/story.rpy:4486
translate spanish story_d599c991:

    # sk "If I'm honest, no."
    sk "Si te soy sincera, no."

# game/story.rpy:4488
translate spanish story_f9f2bde6:

    # sk "That's why I was shocked but not really surprised when you snapped on Monday."
    sk "Por eso me quedé atónita, aunque no demasiado sorprendida, cuando te desbordaste el lunes."

# game/story.rpy:4489
translate spanish story_b3aada40:

    # mc "Well, I promise I'll behave better. And honestly, I'm glad you're in this class with me."
    mc "Bueno, prometo portarme mejor. Y de verdad que me alegra que estés en esta clase conmigo."

# game/story.rpy:4491
translate spanish story_2d049b5b:

    # sk "Oh?"
    sk "¿Eh?"

# game/story.rpy:4492
translate spanish story_ca376540:

    # mc "Yeah. You're one of the only people here who treats me kindly, even if I didn't deserve it."
    mc "Sí. Eres de las pocas personas que me trata bien, aunque no me lo haya merecido."

# game/story.rpy:4493
translate spanish story_a17a9c6e:

    # cm "{i}And I don't...{/i}"
    cm "{i}Y yo no lo...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4494
translate spanish story_8f2a26c7:

    # mc "{b}Stop being so hard on yourself!{/b}"
    mc "{b}¡No seas tan duro contigo mismo!{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4496
translate spanish story_ead650d7:

    # sk "It is my job as class rep, but I guess I am a naturally helpful person."
    sk "Es mi trabajo como delegada, pero supongo que soy una persona que ayuda por naturaleza."

# game/story.rpy:4498
translate spanish story_e83b25e2:

    # mc "Well, I haven't said it, but I am grateful. Really. And yes, I would like the notes from yesterday if you're okay with it."
    mc "Bueno, no lo he dicho, pero estoy agradecido. De verdad. Y sí, me gustaría tener los apuntes de ayer, si te parece."

# game/story.rpy:4500
translate spanish story_243f385d:

    # sk "Of course!"
    sk "¡Claro!"

# game/story.rpy:4503
translate spanish story_647eabf9:

    # "She returns to her desk, three ahead of Meiji's and comes back with a stack of photocopied papers."
    "Regresa a su pupitre, tres por delante del de Meiji, y vuelve con una pila de papeles fotocopiados."

# game/story.rpy:4505
translate spanish story_4b0c4a7e:

    # sk "Here you are."
    sk "Aquí tienes."

# game/story.rpy:4507
translate spanish story_bb0eeaf4_1:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "Gracias."

# game/story.rpy:4509
translate spanish story_8b9e563e:

    # sk "Anytime!"
    sk "¡No es nada!"

# game/story.rpy:4512
translate spanish story_82c9c103:

    # "She returns to her desk and is immediately surrounded by a small group of girls I assume are her friends."
    "Vuelve a su sitio y enseguida la rodea un pequeño grupo de chicas que supongo que son sus amigas."

# game/story.rpy:4513
translate spanish story_bd4f793f:

    # "I begin looking over Mori's notes."
    "Empiezo a ojear los apuntes de Mori."

# game/story.rpy:4515
translate spanish story_f1edf97c:

    # "After a while, Meiji speaks up, and judging from his tone, he feels extremely down."
    "Pasado un rato, Meiji interviene y, a juzgar por su tono, se siente muy bajo de ánimo."

# game/story.rpy:4516
translate spanish story_5685a3a1:

    # cm "{i}Maybe…I should let you take permanent control...you seem to have a better knack at my life than I do.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Quizás... debería dejarte el control permanente... parece que te desenvuelves mejor en mi vida que yo.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4517
translate spanish story_89b6eda8:

    # mc "{b}WHAT?! WHY THE HELL WOULD YOU WANT THAT?!{/b}"
    mc "{b}¡¿QUÉ?! ¡¿POR QUÉ NARICES QUERRÍAS ESO?!{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4518
translate spanish story_d2075ed6:

    # cm "{i}BECAUSE YOU'RE THE ONE MAKING FRIENDS LEFT AND RIGHT!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡PORQUE ERES TÚ QUIEN ESTÁ HACIENDO AMIGOS POR TODAS PARTES!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4520
translate spanish story_9ed134ce:

    # "Oh..."
    "Ah..."

# game/story.rpy:4521
translate spanish story_ac81b645:

    # "I still have little idea how this is affecting Meiji."
    "Sigo sin tener muy clara idea de cómo le está afectando todo esto a Meiji."

# game/story.rpy:4522
translate spanish story_b3c30c82:

    # "He must be super stressed."
    "Debe de estar súper estresado."

# game/story.rpy:4523
translate spanish story_1033d5ad:

    # "I've been too preoccupied to think about it though. Damn."
    "Pero he estado demasiado liado para pensar en ello. Menuda mierda."

# game/story.rpy:4524
translate spanish story_40a729d7:

    # "I feel awful now."
    "Ahora me siento fatal."

# game/story.rpy:4525
translate spanish story_68211b9e:

    # "I stand and begin moving to the exit."
    "Me levanto y me dirijo a la salida."

# game/story.rpy:4526
translate spanish story_2d3ea07d:

    # mc "{b}Meiji, I–{/b}"
    mc "{b}Meiji, yo...{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4527
translate spanish story_25a3a960:

    # cm "{i}No! Don't you dare feel sorry for me! {/i}"
    cm "{i}¡No! ¡No te atrevas a sentir lástima de mí!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4533
translate spanish story_2ac0cdd9:

    # cm "{i}You've been working so hard on my behalf and I don't deserve it! I don't deserve this life! I should just–{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡Has estado trabajando tan duro por mí y no me lo merezco! ¡No merezco esta vida! Yo debería simplemente...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4540
translate spanish story_1b88f674_1:

    # "SMACK!"
    "¡ZAS!"

# game/story.rpy:4541
translate spanish story_b7470658:

    # "I smack myself once again, trying to snap him out of it. Fortunately no one sees."
    "Me doy un bofetón a mí mismo, intentando sacarlo de ahí. Afortunadamente, nadie lo ve."

# game/story.rpy:4542
translate spanish story_927b6640:

    # cm "{i}Ow! Stop doing that!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡Auch! ¡Que no hagas eso!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4543
translate spanish story_e6f56a5a:

    # "Crap, I overreacted. I take a deep breath."
    "Mierda, he reaccionado de más. Respiro hondo."

# game/story.rpy:4544
translate spanish story_b35711bb:

    # mc "{b}Sorry, that's not what I meant.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Perdona, no quería decir eso.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4545
translate spanish story_d351aa3e:

    # mc "{b}Just...calm down, dude. It's fine.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Solo... cálmate, tío. Está bien.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4546
translate spanish story_00226a30:

    # cm "{i}How? How?!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¿Cómo? ¿CÓMO?!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4547
translate spanish story_c199d894:

    # mc "{b}Meiji...{/b}"
    mc "{b}Meiji...{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4548
translate spanish story_89353cfa:

    # cm "{i}No, you don't get it!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡No, no lo entiendes!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4549
translate spanish story_f3ca8515:

    # "I keep forgetting that he's a teen."
    "Sigo olvidando que es un adolescente."

# game/story.rpy:4550
translate spanish story_49427b69:

    # mc "{b}Get what? Meiji, it's alright, really!{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Entender qué? Meiji, no pasa nada, ¡de verdad!{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4551
translate spanish story_be665e18:

    # cm "{i}No, it isn't!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡No, no lo está!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4552
translate spanish story_d66e1469:

    # "We're going around in circles here."
    "Aquí estamos dando vueltas en círculos."

# game/story.rpy:4553
translate spanish story_a1c072b8:

    # "I'm going to try a different approach."
    "Voy a intentar un enfoque diferente."

# game/story.rpy:4554
translate spanish story_709fe89a:

    # mc "{b}You don't think I want you to get better? I'm trying to lead by example here.{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Crees que no quiero que estés mejor? Estoy intentando dar el ejemplo.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4555
translate spanish story_10fce3a6:

    # mc "{b}Believe it or not, I'm a lot like you.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Lo creas o no, me parezco mucho a ti.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4556
translate spanish story_55ad9058:

    # cm "{i}You are?{/i}"
    cm "{i}¿Tú?{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4557
translate spanish story_62176d24:

    # mc "{b}Yeah. I'm somewhat of a loner, but that's okay. You're trying, right?{/b}"
    mc "{b}Sí. Soy medio solitario, pero está bien. Tú lo estás intentando, ¿no?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4558
translate spanish story_da68fdf4:

    # cm "{i}Yeah...I am.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Sí... lo intento.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4559
translate spanish story_763f35f0:

    # mc "{b}Then that's what counts. No one can ask anything else of you.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Entonces eso es lo que cuenta. Nadie puede pedirte nada más.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4560
translate spanish story_520815cb:

    # cm "{i}Yeah...you're right.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Ya, tienes razón...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4561
translate spanish story_34730b73:

    # cm "{i}I'm sorry. I guess I haven't been feeling a lot like myself lately.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Perdona. Supongo que últimamente no me he sentido muy yo mismo.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4562
translate spanish story_e1801af4:

    # mc "{b}I can't blame you, honestly. It's not like I've even tried to give you control back yet.{/b}"
    mc "{b}No te lo echo en cara, de verdad. No es como si hubiera intentado devolverte el control todavía.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4563
translate spanish story_8cb9a123:

    # mc "{b}But today, we're going to tell everyone. After we share poems.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Pero hoy vamos a decírselo a todo el mundo. Después de compartir los poemas.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4567
translate spanish story_bc202f45:

    # cm "{i}Alright...{/i}"
    cm "{i}Vale...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4568
translate spanish story_5bc882a3:

    # "I head back in and class begins moments later..."
    "Vuelvo a entrar y la clase empieza unos instantes después..."

# game/story.rpy:4575
translate spanish story_a2f64ee1:

    # "Lunchtime again!"
    "¡Otra vez la hora de la comida!"

# game/story.rpy:4576
translate spanish story_47bb5783:

    # "I put the books away, stand and stretch."
    "Guardo los libros, me levanto y me estiro."

# game/story.rpy:4577
translate spanish story_c37aca8b:

    # mc "I need a walk."
    mc "Necesito dar una vuelta."

# game/story.rpy:4578
translate spanish story_10dd76f9:

    # mc "{b}Where do you think the clubroom is?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Dónde crees que está la sala de club?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4579
translate spanish story_dfdb6f49:

    # cm "{i}No idea.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Ni idea.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4580
translate spanish story_35e33a48:

    # mc "{b}Then let's just look around.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Pues echemos un vistazo por ahí.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4581
translate spanish story_d31acc12:

    # cm "{i}Why not ask Sayori?{/i}"
    cm "{i}¿Por qué no preguntarle a Sayori?{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4582
translate spanish story_cd465d88:

    # mc "{b}Because she'd want to show us around, and this might be one of the few times we can get Monika alone.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Porque querría enseñárnoslo todo, y esta puede ser una de las pocas veces que podemos quedar a solas con Monika.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4583
translate spanish story_f58beb38:

    # cm "{i}Damn, forgot about the antagonist.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Mierda, me había olvidado de la antagonista.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4584
translate spanish story_b2ad6c74:

    # mc "{b}She's not the antagonist.{/b}"
    mc "{b}No es la antagonista.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4585
translate spanish story_bf8e8589:

    # mc "{b}But we do need to be careful around her. I don't know what she knows, or if she realizes how the game ends.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Pero sí tenemos que tener cuidado con ella. No sé lo que sabe, ni si se da cuenta de cómo acaba el juego.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4586
translate spanish story_bc202f45_1:

    # cm "{i}Alright...{/i}"
    cm "{i}Vale...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4588
translate spanish story_8f680fab:

    # mc "{b}Let's ask a teacher.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Preguntemos a un profesor.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4594
translate spanish story_149a3f17:

    # "I find a teacher and he directs me down another part of the building."
    "Encuentro a un profesor y me dirige a otra parte del edificio."

# game/story.rpy:4595
translate spanish story_9d622d40:

    # "The direction he gives us leads us up a set of stairs to the third floor."
    "La dirección que nos indica nos lleva por una escalera hasta el tercer piso."

# game/story.rpy:4597
translate spanish story_fe3b5722:

    # "As we head there, I notice the number of students decreasing."
    "Mientras nos dirigimos allí, noto que el número de alumnos va disminuyendo."

# game/story.rpy:4598
translate spanish story_4056edaa:

    # mc "{b}Where'd all the students go?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Dónde han ido todos los alumnos?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4599
translate spanish story_c63f6641:

    # cm "{i}I think this part of the school is for the more gifted middle schoolers.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Creo que esta parte del instituto es para los alumnos de ESO más dotados.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4600
translate spanish story_8fe482c2:

    # mc "{b}So, are they just off on break or something?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Estarán en el recreo o algo?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4601
translate spanish story_3aa7eb1c:

    # cm "{i}Probably, yeah.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Tal vez.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4602
translate spanish story_b29c8e77:

    # mc "{b}Yeah, that makes sense.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Ya, puede ser.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4604
translate spanish story_18eb2a46:

    # "We reach the room. Above the door is the label 3-D."
    "Llegamos a la sala. Sobre la puerta hay una etiqueta: 3-D."

# game/story.rpy:4605
translate spanish story_856f7af8:

    # "Weird, wasn't that another classroom's name on the floor below?"
    "Raro, ¿no era el nombre de otro aula en el piso de abajo?"

# game/story.rpy:4606
translate spanish story_e54cd147:

    # "I do {i}not{/i} gently open that door."
    "Abro esa puerta sin la menor suavidad."

# game/story.rpy:4614
translate spanish story_63099ab6:

    # mc "What the hell..."
    mc "Pero ¿qué narices...?"

# game/story.rpy:4615
translate spanish story_476b13b1:

    # "No one's in the room."
    "No hay nadie en la sala."

# game/story.rpy:4617
translate spanish story_01582bb6:

    # "But...if this is an active classroom, wouldn't there be students in here for lunch?"
    "Pero... si es un aula en uso, ¿no debería haber alumnos aquí para comer?"

# game/story.rpy:4618
translate spanish story_5db3788d:

    # "Or perhaps they're all out already?"
    "¿O tal vez ya están todos fuera?"

# game/story.rpy:4619
translate spanish story_4ce049c9:

    # "Does anyone even use this room?"
    "¿Alguien usa siquiera esta sala?"

# game/story.rpy:4620
translate spanish story_35b8e6d6:

    # "I take a good look at the dark room."
    "Examino bien la sala a oscuras."

# game/story.rpy:4621
translate spanish story_1c1e0164:

    # "The windows look over the roof. Wow...that's a great view of the city."
    "Las ventanas dan sobre la azotea. Vaya... qué buena vista de la ciudad."

# game/story.rpy:4622
translate spanish story_8164031c:

    # "And is that...the ocean? Didn't realize I was in a coastal town."
    "¿Y eso es... el océano? No me había dado cuenta de que estaba en un pueblo costero."

# game/story.rpy:4623
translate spanish story_c87585a7:

    # "I look at the desks and see only a handful of schoolbags being hung on the desks near the front."
    "Miro los pupitres y veo solo unas cuantas mochilas colgadas en los de la parte delantera."

# game/story.rpy:4624
translate spanish story_d020e124:

    # "Not many use this classroom if any...huh."
    "Pocos usan este aula, si es que alguien lo hace..."

# game/story.rpy:4625
translate spanish story_b22efe28:

    # "I reach over and turn on the lights."
    "Alargo la mano y enciendo las luces."

# game/story.rpy:4630
translate spanish story_3875541b:

    # mc "Ninth grade classrooms sure look the same as twelfth grade classrooms."
    mc "Las aulas de 3.º de la ESO son muy parecidas a las de 2.º de bachillerato."

# game/story.rpy:4631
translate spanish story_9a922b91:

    # cm "{i}Yeah, this school is a junior and high school mix.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Sí, este instituto mezcla la ESO con el bachillerato.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4632
translate spanish story_fabbb333:

    # mc "Makes sense. Any idea why no one's in this one?"
    mc "Ya. ¿Tienes idea de por qué no hay nadie en esta?"

# game/story.rpy:4633
translate spanish story_fe6a1fb9:

    # cm "{i}Well...I actually have no idea. It's probably a small class.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Bueno... no tengo ni idea. Probablemente sea una clase pequeña.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4634
translate spanish story_49271e55:

    # mc "Yeah probably...well if the teachers are complaining about Natsuki's manga, it has to be used, right?"
    mc "Sí, probablemente... Pero si los profesores se quejan del manga de Natsuki, tienen que estar por aquí, ¿no?"

# game/story.rpy:4635
translate spanish story_c3751116:

    # "I head over to the closet."
    "Me dirijo al armario."

# game/story.rpy:4640
translate spanish story_24de749c:

    # "Yep, there's her manga on the top shelf. And Yuri's tea set."
    "Sip, ahí están sus mangas en la estantería superior. Y el juego de té de Yuri."

# game/story.rpy:4641
translate spanish story_400de30b:

    # cm "{i}Yuri was right, that is similar to ours.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Yuri tenía razón, se parece al nuestro.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4642
translate spanish story_f1a5bf41:

    # mc "Well, I'm not gonna mess with it."
    mc "Bueno, no voy a meterme con eso."

# game/story.rpy:4643
translate spanish story_8ddedd7f:

    # "I secretly move the manga to a lower shelf where I see room."
    "Muevo sigilosamente los mangas a una estantería inferior donde veo hueco."

# game/story.rpy:4648
translate spanish story_2f4feb40:

    # "I head over to the teacher's desk."
    "Me dirijo al escritorio del profesor."

# game/story.rpy:4649
translate spanish story_c571f523:

    # "The computer is off."
    "El ordenador está apagado."

# game/story.rpy:4654
translate spanish story_111ad5f1:

    # "I don't see anything else here, so there's no reason to stay."
    "No veo nada más aquí, así que no hay motivo para quedarse."

# game/story.rpy:4655
translate spanish story_5271dfab:

    # "Besides, if this is being used as a classroom, I should let the students use it."
    "Además, si se usa como aula, debería dejar que los alumnos la usen."

# game/story.rpy:4661
translate spanish story_1eb27d92:

    # "I switch off the lights."
    "Apago las luces."

# game/story.rpy:4667
translate spanish story_23cd7cb8:

    # "I head back out into the hallway and shut the door to the classroom."
    "Salgo otra vez al pasillo y cierro la puerta del aula."

# game/story.rpy:4669
translate spanish story_8f78f93d:

    # "Looking out the window I see that the back of the school is a courtyard."
    "Mirando por la ventana, veo que al fondo del instituto hay un patio."

# game/story.rpy:4670
translate spanish story_bbece3dd:

    # "I look down and spot someone sitting on a bench reading a book."
    "Miro hacia abajo y veo a una persona en un banco leyendo un libro."

# game/story.rpy:4671
translate spanish story_73f42c1a:

    # "She has long black hair."
    "Tiene el pelo largo y negro."

# game/story.rpy:4672
translate spanish story_6d8c91d7:

    # mc "Is that Yuri?"
    mc "¿Será Yuri?"

# game/story.rpy:4673
translate spanish story_e75d7084:

    # cm "{i}Looks like it.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Parece que sí.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4674
translate spanish story_bc88c9ab:

    # mc "Maybe she finished her lunch early."
    mc "Quizás acabó de comer antes."

# game/story.rpy:4676
translate spanish story_ad1ef070:

    # cm "{i}Uh oh...she's in trouble.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Vaya... está metida en líos.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4677
translate spanish story_cd63ed0e:

    # "I look slightly to the left and see a group of teenagers pointing at her from a distance and laughing."
    "Miro un poco a la izquierda y veo a un grupo de adolescentes señalándola desde lejos y riéndose."

# game/story.rpy:4678
translate spanish story_6deaf612:

    # mc "Are you kidding...Yuri too?!"
    mc "¿Estamos de coña...? ¡¿Hasta Yuri?!"

# game/story.rpy:4679
translate spanish story_3a6e3bca:

    # "Maiden of Mystery protection skills activated!"
    "¡Activando las habilidades de protección de la Dama del Misterio!"

# game/story.rpy:4680
translate spanish story_d432081c:

    # "I rush down to the courtyard."
    "Corro hacia el patio."

# game/story.rpy:4681
translate spanish story_3e8ef7bd:

    # "Screw no running in the halls! Yuri needs help!"
    "¡Al diablo con lo de no correr por los pasillos! ¡Yuri necesita ayuda!"

# game/story.rpy:4683
translate spanish story_87b117fd:

    # "Meiji doesn't try and stop me this time, only gives me directions to the back school entrance."
    "Esta vez Meiji no intenta detenerme, solo me indica la entrada trasera del instituto."

# game/story.rpy:4688
translate spanish story_d382823c:

    # "I run over and see the group surrounding Yuri."
    "Corro hasta allí y veo al grupo rodeando a Yuri."

# game/story.rpy:4690
translate spanish story_d1c3728e:

    # "She looks terrified."
    "Parece aterrorizada."

# game/story.rpy:4691
translate spanish story_28785df4:

    # "All around her are a group of students."
    "A su alrededor hay un grupo de alumnos."

# game/story.rpy:4692
translate spanish story_638398c5:

    # s1 "...you slut!"
    s1 "¡... Puta zorra!"

# game/story.rpy:4693
translate spanish story_de9791aa:

    # s1 "You're the silent kinky type, aren't you baby? Come over and I'll show you a good time."
    s1 "Tú eres de las calladitas y perversas, ¿no, guapa? Ven aquí y te haré pasar un buen rato."

# game/story.rpy:4694
translate spanish story_714ce5dc:

    # "I resist the urge to pummel them all into the earth."
    "Me resisto al impulso de dejarlas a todas en coma permanente."

# game/story.rpy:4695
translate spanish story_ec7fb1b2:

    # "I made a promise, after all."
    "Debo recordar que hice una promesa."

# game/story.rpy:4696
translate spanish story_926642ed:

    # ss2 "Seriously, what's with those udders? Betcha they could produce enough milk to feed the entire school."
    ss2 "Venga, ¿y esas ubres que cargas? Apuesto a que podrían producir leche para todo el instituto."

# game/story.rpy:4697
translate spanish story_8023c5e6:

    # "How are they getting away with this?!"
    "¡¿Cómo pueden permitirse esta porquería?!"

# game/story.rpy:4698
translate spanish story_56f9b19f:

    # s3 "And what's with this book?"
    s3 "¿Y qué mierda es ese libro?"

# game/story.rpy:4699
translate spanish story_cb8e7ff5:

    # "The student grabs it from Yuri."
    "La alumna se lo arrebata a Yuri."

# game/story.rpy:4701
translate spanish story_c8ccdd3b:

    # y "Ah! P-Please give that back!"
    y "¡Ah! P-Por favor, devuélvemelo!"

# game/story.rpy:4702
translate spanish story_6f90f207:

    # ss2 "What a creepy looking book!"
    ss2 "¡Qué libro tan escalofriante!"

# game/story.rpy:4703
translate spanish story_cb7d5c1e:

    # ss2 "Figures you'd read this garbage!"
    ss2 "¡Seguro que lees esta niñería!"

# game/story.rpy:4704
translate spanish story_3017995d:

    # "Before anyone can respond, I calmly walk up and snatch the book from the person who'd stolen it."
    "Antes de que nadie pueda responder, me acerco con calma y le arrebato el libro a quien lo había robado."

# game/story.rpy:4705
translate spanish story_d3805cdd:

    # "I smile politely."
    "Sonrío con cortesía."

# game/story.rpy:4706
translate spanish story_2c270875:

    # "No smartassery...no smartassery..."
    "Sin chulerías... sin chulerías..."

# game/story.rpy:4707
translate spanish story_84b45058:

    # mc "Hello there."
    mc "Hola."

# game/story.rpy:4708
translate spanish story_322dcb1f:

    # s1 "And here's another loser."
    s1 "Y aquí tenemos a otro perdedor."

# game/story.rpy:4710
translate spanish story_8b39a48f:

    # y 3p "M-Meiji?"
    y 3p "¿M-Meiji?"

# game/story.rpy:4711
translate spanish story_663449e3:

    # mc "Hey. I came to get you. Monika wanted to talk to you."
    mc "Hola. He venido a buscarte. Monika quería hablar contigo."

# game/story.rpy:4712
translate spanish story_2e5b74af:

    # y 3t "Eh? What about?"
    y 3t "¿Eh? ¿Sobre qué?"

# game/story.rpy:4713
translate spanish story_b0be3fc3:

    # mc "She didn't say. Come on, she's waiting in the clubroom."
    mc "No lo ha dicho. Vamos, te espera en la sala de club."

# game/story.rpy:4714
translate spanish story_dfe426ff:

    # "I hold out my hand and help her up."
    "Le tiendo la mano y la ayudo a levantarse."

# game/story.rpy:4715
translate spanish story_65f35b77:

    # y 3u "Thanks..."
    y 3u "Gracias..."

# game/story.rpy:4716
translate spanish story_c65adcc1:

    # u "Hey, what's the big idea butting in, you nerd?"
    u "Oye, ¿qué se te ha ocurrido meterte aquí, nerd?"

# game/story.rpy:4719
translate spanish story_384cd48e:

    # "One of the girls grabs my shirt and pulls me back."
    "Una de las chicas me agarra de la camiseta y me tira hacia atrás."

# game/story.rpy:4722
translate spanish story_e6cea4ba:

    # u "Who said you could interrupt our fun?"
    u "¿Quién te ha dicho que puedes interrumpir nuestra diversión?"

# game/story.rpy:4724
translate spanish story_6f704815:

    # cm "{i}Oh shit...that's Kawahashi Yae! She's worse than Tani-san was.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Mierda... ¡es Kawahashi Yae! Es peor que Tani-san.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4725
translate spanish story_5a53cf29:

    # "I turn to her."
    "Me giro hacia ella."

# game/story.rpy:4726
translate spanish story_95b62f95:

    # mc "Aaah, my most sincere apologies. But this is really important and can't wait."
    mc "Ah, mil disculpas. Pero esto es de verdad importante y no puede esperar."

# game/story.rpy:4730
translate spanish story_5f2bfad8:

    # yae "You don't get to interrupt us!"
    yae "¡No puedes interrumpirnos!"

# game/story.rpy:4732
translate spanish story_01c452d6:

    # k "I'd leave him alone if I were you."
    k "Yo lo dejaría en paz si fuera tú."

# game/story.rpy:4735
translate spanish story_520de685:

    # mc "{b}Kozue? What's she doing here?{/b}"
    mc "{b}¿Kozue? ¿Qué hace ella aquí?{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4736
translate spanish story_f07d033c:

    # cm "{i}Your guess is as good as mine.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Yo tampoco sabría decirlo.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4738
translate spanish story_315eacf6:

    # k "Seriously, he's not someone you should be messing with."
    k "En serio, no es alguien con quien deberíais estar liándoos."

# game/story.rpy:4741
translate spanish story_4971929a:

    # yae "Since when did you start defending this low life?"
    yae "¿Desde cuándo defiendes a este desecho?"

# game/story.rpy:4744
translate spanish story_82390039:

    # k "Since nunya...nunya business!"
    k "Desde que... ¡n-no es asunto tuyo!"

# game/story.rpy:4747
translate spanish story_1651dca7:

    # yae "Hah! Like I need to listen to you!"
    yae "¡Ja! ¡Como si hubiera de hacerte caso!"

# game/story.rpy:4749
translate spanish story_346026cb:

    # m "Then listen to me!"
    m "¡Entonces escúchame a mí!"

# game/story.rpy:4753
translate spanish story_6fbbe63a:

    # "Monika now?!"
    "¡¿Y ahora Monika?!"

# game/story.rpy:4754
translate spanish story_cad7a965:

    # "Wow...I've never seen her this angry before."
    "Vaya... nunca la había visto tan enfadada."

# game/story.rpy:4756
translate spanish story_6fc34b30:

    # m "Yuri is in my club, Kawahashi."
    m "Yuri está en mi club, Kawahashi."

# game/story.rpy:4758
translate spanish story_616ed9b8:

    # m 8zc "YOU DON'T GET TO LAY A HAND ON HER WITHOUT ME DOING SOMETHING ABOUT IT!"
    m 8zc "¡NO TOCARÉIS A YURI SIN PASAR POR MI PUTÍSIMO CADÁVER PERRAS DE MIERDA!"

# game/story.rpy:4760
translate spanish story_a20cefa7_5:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/story.rpy:4761
translate spanish story_39c72fb2:

    # mc "{b}Oh shit, I didn't think she could get that angry.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Joder, no creía que pudiera ponerse tan enojada.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4762
translate spanish story_355f9eb6:

    # cm "{i}Yeah...{/i}"
    cm "{i}Sí...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4763
translate spanish story_d4364bb4:

    # mc "{b}Remind me never to piss her off.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Recuérdame nunca hacerla enfadar.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4767
translate spanish story_360fcfab:

    # "Yuri's hiding behind me now. It looks like the three girls are about to fight."
    "Yuri se esconde detrás de mí ahora. Parece que las tres chicas van a pelearse."

# game/story.rpy:4768
translate spanish story_4a4a358b:

    # "Welp, time to do something I've no experience in."
    "Pues ya, toca hacer algo en lo que no tengo ninguna experiencia."

# game/story.rpy:4769
translate spanish story_dda525b9:

    # "Diffusing a tense situation."
    "Desactivar una situación tensa."

# game/story.rpy:4770
translate spanish story_0fab4472:

    # mc "Okay everyone, enough of this. There's no need to escalate this any further."
    mc "Vale, compis, basta ya. No hace falta escalar esto más."

# game/story.rpy:4771
translate spanish story_4395f8ef:

    # mc "Let's just...go our separate ways for today and cool our heads."
    mc "Simplemente... cada uno por su lado por hoy y que enfriemos los ánimos."

# game/story.rpy:4773
translate spanish story_c6a3bbc8:

    # yae "Not a chance in hell!"
    yae "¡Ni lo sueñes!"

# game/story.rpy:4775
translate spanish story_b0c36db6:

    # mc "Then it looks like it's my turn to be the more mature one here."
    mc "Pues parece que toca ser el más maduro de la sala."

# game/story.rpy:4776
translate spanish story_75bfe4a2:

    # "I put a hand on Monika's and Kozue's shoulders."
    "Pongo una mano en el hombro de Monika y otra en el de Kozue."

# game/story.rpy:4780
