# game/story.rpy:5240
translate spanish story_84d0931f:

    # mc "{b}Yeah, yeah.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Sí, sí.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:5241
translate spanish story_b5c16a02:

    # mc "I realized I didn't have much time left before graduation, and I wanted to spend some time enjoying myself and expanding my horizons a bit more."
    mc "Me di cuenta de que no me quedaba mucho tiempo antes de graduarme, y quería pasar un rato disfrutando y ampliando mis horizontes un poco más."

# game/story.rpy:5242
translate spanish story_e13c3a53:

    # n 5c "Well...good! Because if you just planned on coming here to hang out or whatever, I would have been pissed."
    n 5c "Bueeeno... ¡pues guay! Porque si solo pensabas venir a por cupcakes, me habría cabreado."

# game/story.rpy:5243
translate spanish story_191a8b1d:

    # n 4c "You need to take us seriously or you won't see the end of it."
    n 4c "Pero, si te burlas de nosotras, te prometo que te las verás conmigo."

# game/story.rpy:5245
translate spanish story_2a67fcb3:

    # mc "I'll keep that in mind."
    mc "Descuida, lo tendré en cuenta."

# game/story.rpy:5247
translate spanish story_b57601ba:

    # m "I'm surprised at you, Natsuki. You've got a big mouth for someone who keeps their manga in the clubroom."
    m "Natsuki, que guardas tus mangas en el club. No eres quién para ponerte bravucona."

# game/story.rpy:5249
translate spanish story_28526ae4:

    # n 4o "M-M-M...!!"
    n 4o "¡E-E-E...!!"

# game/story.rpy:5250
translate spanish story_3434a458:

    # "Seriously, why is she keeping to the script?"
    "No, ya en serio, ¿por qué sigue el guion?"

# game/story.rpy:5252
translate spanish story_6aec4dfe:

    # mc "Whoa whoa whoa, are you dissing manga there, Madame President?"
    mc "Ey, ey, para el carro."
    mc "¿Acaso vuestra madre sabe que despreciáis el manga?"

# game/story.rpy:5254
translate spanish story_c0f96682:

    # m 1z "Oho? And what's your opinion, {i}Meiji{/i}?"
    m 1z "¿Eh? ¿Y cuál es tu opinión, Meiji?"

# game/story.rpy:5255
translate spanish story_3ddf812b:

    # "I chuckle."
    "Suelto una risita."

# game/story.rpy:5256
translate spanish story_a9d0a508:

    # mc "I happen to believe all forms of literature have something to offer, whether it be books that are hundreds of years old or manga that was published last week."
    mc "Personalmente, creo que todas las formas de literatura tienen algo que ofrecer, ya sean libros de cientos de años de antigüedad o mangas publicados la semana pasada."

# game/story.rpy:5259
translate spanish story_438100b9:

    # "This answer seems to please both Yuri and Natsuki."
    "Esta respuesta parece complacer tanto a Yuri como a Natsuki."

# game/story.rpy:5260
translate spanish story_ed1718e0:

    # "Natsuki especially seems pleased by my answer."
    "Natsuki parece complacida en especial con mi respuesta."

# game/story.rpy:5261
translate spanish story_342880af:

    # n 4l "You're not half bad, newbie."
    n 4l "No está mal, novato."

# game/story.rpy:5264
translate spanish story_ec485ddb:

    # "Natsuki triumphantly returns to her desk."
    "Natsuki vuelve triunfalmente a su pupitre."

# game/story.rpy:5267
translate spanish story_e9ad78fe:

    # "Monika returns to the teacher's desk, chuckling."
    "Monika vuelve al escritorio del profesor, soltando una risita."

# game/story.rpy:5271
translate spanish story_4c153c59:

    # "The door then quickly slides open."
    "Entonces la puerta se desliza y se abre."

# game/story.rpy:5272
translate spanish story_db9dbb53:

    # s "Has anyone...hah...seen-AH!"
    s "¿Alguien... ahhh... a... visto... ¡AH!"

# game/story.rpy:5275
translate spanish story_62f552c6:

    # s "There you are, Meiji!"
    s "¡Con que aquí estás, Meiji!"

# game/story.rpy:5276
translate spanish story_66d06f53:

    # "Sayori enters the room, panting pretty heavily like she'd been running."
    "Sayori entra, jadeando bastante, como si hubiera estado en un maratón."

# game/story.rpy:5277
translate spanish story_6c7971bb:

    # s 2h "I was going to show you where the clubroom was but I guess you figured out where we were already."
    s 2h "Iba a enseñarte dónde estaba la sala de club, pero supongo que ya lo averiguaste."

# game/story.rpy:5279
translate spanish story_cf38b4c6:

    # mc "I asked a teacher at lunch and checked out the clubroom for a few minutes."
    mc "Le pregunté a un profesor a la hora de comer y eché un vistazo al club durante unos minutos."

# game/story.rpy:5280
translate spanish story_278881c7:

    # s 1a "Oh, okay! So what were you guys talking about before I came in?"
    s 1a "¡Ah, vale! ¿De qué hablabais antes de que entrara?"

# game/story.rpy:5281
translate spanish story_6443ceb1:

    # "I take a half minute to bring her up to speed."
    "Tardo medio minuto en ponerla al día."

# game/story.rpy:5282
translate spanish story_2c6ec804:

    # s 2x "Don't worry, guys~"
    s 2x "No os preocupéis..."

# game/story.rpy:5283
translate spanish story_596cec24:

    # s "Meiji always gives it his best as long as he's having fun."
    s "Meiji siempre lo da todo cuando se está divirtiendo."

# game/story.rpy:5284
translate spanish story_f466355f:

    # s "He helps me with busywork without me even asking."
    s "Me ayuda con mis tareas sin que tenga que pedírselo siquiera."

# game/story.rpy:5285
translate spanish story_13c9b95d:

    # s "Like cooking, cleaning my room..."
    s "Como cocinar, ordenar mi cuarto..."

# game/story.rpy:5287
translate spanish story_81e9271b:

    # "See, Sayori and the others I can kind of understand following the script a bit, although that bit with Yuri is a bit concerning."
    "A ver, con Sayori y las demás puedo entender un poco que sigan el guion, aunque lo de Yuri es un poco preocupante."

# game/story.rpy:5288
translate spanish story_b77cceeb:

    # "But...why Monika?"
    "Pero... ¿por qué Monika?"

# game/story.rpy:5290
translate spanish story_3bd6ebc4:

    # y "How dependable..."
    y "Qué buenazo..."

# game/story.rpy:5293
translate spanish story_af8e0816:

    # mc "Sayori...for one, your room can get pretty messy."
    mc "Sayori... por un lado, tu habitación puede estar bastante desordenada."

# game/story.rpy:5294
translate spanish story_3f900e9c:

    # s 2b "Eh?"
    s 2b "¿Eh?"

# game/story.rpy:5295
translate spanish story_c678f76a:

    # mc "This may sound strange for me of all people to say, but a cluttered room is the sign of a cluttered mind."
    mc "Puede sonar raro viniendo de mí, siendo quien soy, pero una habitación desordenada es señal de una mente desordenada."

# game/story.rpy:5296
translate spanish story_600f8647:

    # mc "Living like that can only encourage a more cluttered lifestyle, so I clean it to help unclutter your mind and mine."
    mc "Vivir así solo puede alentar un estilo de vida más desordenado, así que la limpio para ayudar a despejar tu mente y la mía."

# game/story.rpy:5297
translate spanish story_14574738:

    # mc "And as for cooking, well, need I remind you of...the Incident?"
    mc "Y en cuanto a cocinar, bueno, ¿necesito recordarte el... incidente?"

# game/story.rpy:5299
translate spanish story_94c1e18c:

    # s 5a "No..."
    s 5a "No... claro que no..."

# game/story.rpy:5300
translate spanish story_92859797:

    # cm "{i}I was so scared when she somehow set water of all things on fire.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Me asusté muchísimo cuando quemó el agua.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:5301
translate spanish story_e3e4a9ce:

    # cm "{i}Thinking back, I yelled at her a bit much.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Pensándolo bien, le grité un poco de más.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:5302
translate spanish story_29a526d6:

    # mc "I didn't think I had to."
    mc "No creía que hiciera falta."

# game/story.rpy:5303
translate spanish story_a16d75ea:

    # mc "Honestly, Sayori, I was scared something would happen to you, and I still am."
    mc "De verdad, Sayori, me daba miedo que te pasara algo, y sigo igual."

# game/story.rpy:5304
translate spanish story_4f796977:

    # mc "So until you're better at cooking on your own, no cooking for you without adult supervision."
    mc "Así que hasta que seas mejor cocinando sola, nada de cocinar sin supervisión adulta."

# game/story.rpy:5305
translate spanish story_2372de2e:

    # mc "Also, the way I reacted back then was a bit much, so I'm sorry."
    mc "Además, mi reacción de entonces fue un poco de más, así que lo siento."

# game/story.rpy:5308
translate spanish story_c06c8587:

    # y "You two are really good friends, aren't you?"
    y "Sois muy buenos amigos, ¿verdad?"

# game/story.rpy:5309
translate spanish story_5150f59d:

    # y "I might be a little jealous..."
    y "A lo mejor me pongo un poco celosa..."

# game/story.rpy:5310
translate spanish story_8bcbb346:

    # mc "She's my bestest friend."
    mc "Cómo no, es mi mejor amiga."

# game/story.rpy:5312
translate spanish story_396221bf:

    # "I rub her hair playfully."
    "Le revuelvo el pelo con gesto juguetón."

# game/story.rpy:5313
translate spanish story_d2212fb9:

    # mc "But that doesn't mean I can't become friends with you all."
    mc "Pero eso no significa que no pueda hacerme amigo de vosotras."

# game/story.rpy:5314
translate spanish story_a0bbcb82:

    # mc "In fact, I'd consider it an honor if we could become friends."
    mc "Es más, lo consideraría un honor si pudiéramos hacernos amigos."

# game/story.rpy:5315
translate spanish story_6b651926:

    # y 4e "Y-You mean it?"
    y 4e "¿L-Lo dices en serio?"

# game/story.rpy:5316
translate spanish story_15cfefa6:

    # mc "I do mean it, and not just you, but Monika and Muramoto-san as well, who I know have been eavesdropping."
    mc "Lo digo en serio, y no solo a ti, sino también a Monika y Muramoto-san, a quienes sé que han estado escuchando."

# game/story.rpy:5320
translate spanish story_b526f957:

    # n "Oh please! It's hard not to!"
    n "¡Venga ya! ¡Es difícil no hacerlo!"

# game/story.rpy:5322
translate spanish story_d5ae2301_2:

    # mc "Fair enough."
    mc "Vale, vale."

# game/story.rpy:5329
translate spanish story_1fa54f63:

    # "I then turn to Monika, who {i}has{/i} been listening in this whole time."
    "Entonces me giro hacia Monika, que ha estado escuchando todo este tiempo."

# game/story.rpy:5330
translate spanish story_d0edbc2d:

    # mc "So, Madame President."
    mc "Así que, Madame President."

# game/story.rpy:5332
translate spanish story_7a5c1899:

    # m "Yes?"
    m "¿Sí?"

# game/story.rpy:5333
translate spanish story_206cdb7b:

    # mc "Is there anything you have planned today?"
    mc "¿Tenéis algo planeado para hoy?"

# game/story.rpy:5334
translate spanish story_7e1de2a5:

    # m 4b "Nothing aside from poem sharing, but we can do that later."
    m 4b "Nada aparte de compartir poemas, pero eso lo podemos hacer luego."

# game/story.rpy:5335
translate spanish story_c29c93f9:

    # mc "Heh, oh great, the tension is {i}killing{/i} me."
    mc "Je, vaya, la tensión me está matando."

# game/story.rpy:5338
translate spanish story_68256f8c:

    # "I sit in a desk close to Monika, then pull out the two books, the next volume of {i}Parfait Girls{/i} and {i}Portrait of Markov{/i}."
    "Me siento en un pupitre cerca de Monika y luego saco los dos libros, el siguiente volumen de {i}Parfait Girls{/i} y {i}El retrato de Markov{/i}."

# game/story.rpy:5345
translate spanish story_a65ba23d:

    # "I start with {i}Portrait of Markov{/i}."
    "Empiezo con {i}El retrato de Markov{/i}."

# game/story.rpy:5346
translate spanish story_d0658d4f:

    # "The plot continues to develop from the chapter I left off with."
    "La trama sigue desarrollándose desde el capítulo en el que lo dejé."

# game/story.rpy:5348
translate spanish story_3f0af43f:

    # "Fujiko made her way home and asked her new sister about what the Third Eye was."
    "Fujiko volvió a casa y le preguntó a su nueva hermana qué era el tercer ojo."

# game/story.rpy:5349
translate spanish story_82c9929e:

    # "Masae looked a bit uncomfortable and Fujiko was about to tell Masae to forget it but Masae explained."
    "Masae parecía un poco incómoda y Fujiko estaba a punto de decirle que lo olvidara, pero Masae explicó."

# game/story.rpy:5350
translate spanish story_e33b12d8:

    # "Apparently, the Third Eye was a town myth about an experiment done on locals by the government during World War II."
    "Parece que el tercer ojo era un mito del pueblo acerca de un experimento que el gobierno realizó con los lugareños durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial."

# game/story.rpy:5351
translate spanish story_04b012f6:

    # "The abandoned facility where human experimentation on POW's was located in the mountains near Yuuna."
    "La instalación abandonada donde se realizaron experimentos humanos con prisioneros de guerra estaba en las montañas cerca de Yuuna."

# game/story.rpy:5352
translate spanish story_22ba85fa:

    # "The rumor went that the experiments were meant to bring out some sort of psychic power the researchers believed existed in humans called the Third Eye."
    "El rumor decía que los experimentos pretendían desbloquear cierto tipo de poder psíquico que los investigadores creían que existía en los humanos, llamado el tercer ojo."

# game/story.rpy:5353
translate spanish story_5a817789:

    # "But...what that meant varied from person to person in the town."
    "Pero... lo que eso significaba variaba de persona a persona en el pueblo."

# game/story.rpy:5354
translate spanish story_957e24d3:

    # "Some even claimed that after Japan surrendered, the researchers didn't shut down the facility and were still there, looking for what they believed was the perfect sacrifice."
    "Algunos incluso afirmaban que, tras la rendición de Japón, los investigadores no cerraron la instalación y seguían allí, buscando lo que creían que era el sacrificio perfecto."

# game/story.rpy:5355
translate spanish story_4c69df0c:

    # "With that information, Fujiko, ever the curious but self-conscious teen (especially over her developing body), decided to visit the town's library and do some research."
    "Con esa información, Fujiko, siempre curiosa pero insegura con su cuerpo de adolescente (especialmente por su desarrollo), decidió visitar la biblioteca del pueblo e investigar."

# game/story.rpy:5356
translate spanish story_b97980c6:

    # "The computer was down for repairs, but she was a very good researcher."
    "El ordenador estaba en reparaciones, pero ella era una muy buena investigadora."

# game/story.rpy:5357
translate spanish story_9de4ecb6:

    # "She found a stack of books detailing local legends and began taking notes and comparing."
    "Encontró una pila de libros que detallaban leyendas locales y empezó a tomar notas y a comparar."

# game/story.rpy:5358
translate spanish story_1fe3592c:

    # "When the chapter ends with Fujiko going out with her new family for a welcome dinner, I find it hard to put it down."
    "Cuando el capítulo termina con Fujiko saliendo con su nueva familia para una cena de bienvenida, me cuesta soltar el libro."

# game/story.rpy:5362
translate spanish story_1cd9bfb6:

    # "Next I pick up {i}Parfait Girls{/i}."
    "Después cojo {i}Parfait Girls{/i}."

# game/story.rpy:5363
translate spanish story_c582ac1f:

    # "The plot only gets more interesting as I continue."
    "La trama solo se pone más interesante a medida que sigo."

# game/story.rpy:5365
translate spanish story_811d5330:

    # "The first club meeting of the new cooking club started the very next day."
    "La primera reunión del nuevo club de cocina empezó al día siguiente."

# game/story.rpy:5366
translate spanish story_eaff64b6:

    # "Minori had taken on the role of club President by this volume."
    "Para este volumen, Minori había asumido el papel de presidenta del club."

# game/story.rpy:5367
translate spanish story_b1e8e117:

    # "The first scene was of her sitting in her room, trying to plan out club activities for the cooking club."
    "La primera escena la mostraba sentada en su habitación, intentando planear actividades para el club de cocina."

# game/story.rpy:5368
translate spanish story_f9c6e920:

    # "One of the panels showed her room as covered with pieces of crumbled up paper."
    "Uno de los paneles mostraba su habitación cubierta de papeles arrugados."

# game/story.rpy:5369
translate spanish story_fe79cec0:

    # "She looked like she was about to cry, but then an idea struck her."
    "Parecía a punto de llorar, pero entonces se le ocurrió una idea."

# game/story.rpy:5370
translate spanish story_624acba7:

    # "She quickly wrote it down."
    "La anotó rápidamente."

# game/story.rpy:5371
translate spanish story_93e5b7c5:

    # "She texted the other club members and announced they would be doing a taste competition."
    "Mandó un mensaje a sus compañeras de club y anunció que harían una competición de degustación."

# game/story.rpy:5372
translate spanish story_aade1154:

    # "She had two suggestions, either make the dishes at the club or make them at home and bring them in the following day."
    "Tenía dos sugerencias: o cocinar los platos en el club, o hacerlos en casa y traerlos al día siguiente."

# game/story.rpy:5373
translate spanish story_c0adf708:

    # "When everyone agreed to make them at the club, she told them to bring any ingredients they might need in case the school didn't provide any."
    "Cuando todas estuvieron de acuerdo en cocinarlos en el club, les dijo que trajeran los ingredientes que necesitaran por si el instituto no los tuviera."

# game/story.rpy:5374
translate spanish story_436fa34e:

    # "They all showed up with ingredients for their own cupcakes."
    "Todas se presentaron con ingredientes para sus propios cupcakes."

# game/story.rpy:5377
translate spanish story_ceb59b5e:

    # mc "Heh...of course."
    mc "Je... claro."

# game/story.rpy:5385
translate spanish story_dd8c33b0:

    # m "What's so funny?"
    m "¿Qué hay de tan gracioso?"

# game/story.rpy:5386
translate spanish story_3d2b8a01:

    # mc "Oh, the irony of this."
    mc "Ah, la ironía de esto."

# game/story.rpy:5387
translate spanish story_31f6f905:

    # "I hold up the manga."
    "Levanto el manga."

# game/story.rpy:5388
translate spanish story_09fa60d5:

    # mc "Their first challenge is cupcake making and they have to share it with each other. Reminds me of our poem sharing."
    mc "Su primer reto es hacer cupcakes y tienen que compartirlos entre ellas. Me recuerda a nuestro intercambio de poemas."

# game/story.rpy:5389
translate spanish story_e4b6dac4:

    # m 4b "Speaking of which, I think it's time to share poems."
    m 4b "Hablando de ello, creo que es hora de compartir poemas."

# game/story.rpy:5390
translate spanish story_8a9aa0cb:

    # m 1 "You did remember to write a poem, right?"
    m 1 "Recordaste escribir un poema, ¿verdad?"

# game/story.rpy:5391
translate spanish story_5813d8c7:

    # mc "Damn right I did. I will admit, this is an older one. I wanted to get your opinions on my older work before I tried something new."
    mc "¡Claro! Admito que es uno antiguo. Quería tener vuestras opiniones sobre mi trabajo anterior antes de probar algo nuevo."

# game/story.rpy:5392
translate spanish story_7d9cc8d0:

    # m 6j "That's alright. I look forward to seeing it."
    m 6j "No pasa nada. Espero con ganas verlo."

# game/story.rpy:5393
translate spanish story_62e7b28a:

    # "Monika begins calling out to the club members, but I hold up my hand."
    "Monika empieza a llamar a las compañeras del club, pero levanto la mano."

# game/story.rpy:5395
translate spanish story_58e92ffd:

    # mc "Allow me."
    mc "Permetidme."

# game/story.rpy:5396
translate spanish story_26904e07:

    # "Sorry, Markiplier."
    "Perdona, Markiplier."

# game/story.rpy:5397
translate spanish story_f0fc440a:

    # mc "Okay, everyone! Shut your traps! Ding Dong! Bing Bong! Time to read your poems! Here Monika doth decree that it's time!"
    mc "¡Vale, compis! ¡Cerrad el pico! ¡Ding dong! ¿Quién es...? ¡Es Monika decretando la hora de recitar!"

# game/story.rpy:5398
translate spanish story_bcf472ae:

    # "I point to an imaginary watch on my wrist."
    "Apunto a un reloj imaginario en mi muñeca."

# game/story.rpy:5400
translate spanish story_35bf719a:

    # "Monika bursts out laughing."
    "Monika estalla en carcajadas."

# game/story.rpy:5403
translate spanish story_55951c4e:

    # n "What the hell was that?"
    n "¿Pero qué narices ha sido eso?"

# game/story.rpy:5406
translate spanish story_38d2c0b9:

    # mc "Just alerting you all."
    mc "Solo avisando, ha sido un gusto."

# game/story.rpy:5409
translate spanish story_98e050dd:

    # m 4b "Well, now that everyone's ready, why don't you find someone to share with?"
    m 4b "Vale, ahora que todos estáis listos, ¿por qué no buscáis a alguien con quien compartir?"

# game/story.rpy:5412
translate spanish story_ebf4c7a9:

    # s "I can't wait~!"
    s "¡No puedo esperar!"

# game/story.rpy:5417
translate spanish story_004c09ad:

    # "I watch as Sayori and Monika enthusiastically pull out their poems."
    "Miro cómo Sayori y Monika sacan sus poemas con entusiasmo."

# game/story.rpy:5418
translate spanish story_655c987a:

    # "Just like in the game, Sayori's is on a wrinkled sheet of loose leaf torn from a spiral notebook."
    "Como en el juego, el de Sayori está en una hoja arrugada arrancada de un cuaderno espiral."

# game/story.rpy:5419
translate spanish story_5cab124c:

    # "Monika pulls out a very familiar composition notebook."
    "Monika saca un cuaderno de composición muy familiar."

# game/story.rpy:5420
translate spanish story_31f0b882:

    # "I can already see Monika's handwriting from where I sit."
    "Ya puedo ver la letra de Monika desde aquí."

# game/story.rpy:5421
translate spanish story_42a4c0fb:

    # "It really is quite good."
    "En verdad es muy buena."

# game/story.rpy:5422
translate spanish story_7354e005:

    # "Natsuki and Yuri reluctantly comply as well, reaching into their bags."
    "Natsuki y Yuri también se pliegan a regañadientes, metiendo la mano en sus mochilas."

# game/story.rpy:5423
translate spanish story_17eb3c70:

    # "Moment of truth."
    "Hora de la verdad."

# game/story.rpy:5424
translate spanish story_0b24048f:

    # mc "{b}Here we go...wish me luck.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Allá voy... cruzad los dedos.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:5425
translate spanish story_0273e2a0:

    # cm "{i}You'll be fine, dude.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Confio en ti.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:5426
translate spanish story_d77bb1e6:

    # mc "{b}Thanks...{/b}"
    mc "{b}Gracias...{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:5427
translate spanish story_4deec30a:

    # "I nervously approach Monika..."
    "Me acerco lentamente a Monika..."

# game/story.rpy:5429
translate spanish story_b69b70f3:

    # mc "Hey there, Monika."
    mc "Hola, Monika."

# game/story.rpy:5430
translate spanish story_c54e0160:

    # m 1b "Hi, Meiji!"
    m 1b "¡Hola, Meiji!"

# game/story.rpy:5431
translate spanish story_1bd46f58:

    # m "Having a good time so far?"
    m "¿Te lo estás pasando bien hasta ahora?"

# game/story.rpy:5432
translate spanish story_20bccb56:

    # mc "I am, {i}for the most part{/i}. It's nice to have a dedicated space to read without much interruption."
    mc "Sí, en su mayor parte. Es agradable tener un espacio dedicado a leer sin muchas interrupciones."

# game/story.rpy:5434
translate spanish story_0df82849:

    # m 1f "For the most part?"
    m 1f "¿En su mayor parte?"

# game/story.rpy:5436
translate spanish story_5c2d2fb4:

    # mc "Yeah, the only thing I'm uncertain about..."
    mc "Sí, lo único de lo que no estoy seguro..."

# game/story.rpy:5438
translate spanish story_5dfe535e:

    # "I lean in closer. She does the same, looking curiously at me."
    "Me acerco un poco más. Ella hace lo mismo, mirándome con curiosidad."

# game/story.rpy:5439
translate spanish story_1deea4c3:

    # "I lower my voice so only she can hear."
    "Bajo la voz para que solo ella me oiga."

# game/story.rpy:5440
translate spanish story_3447d4c2:

    # mc "...is whether or not I can trust you yet."
    mc "... es si puedo confiar en ti todavía."

# game/story.rpy:5442
translate spanish story_9ca5fd9a:

    # "Monika moves back, looking at me intently."
    "Monika se aparta, mirándome fijamente."

# game/story.rpy:5443
translate spanish story_03c986b6:

    # "Her suspicions must be confirmed."
    "Sus sospechas deben de estar confirmadas."

# game/story.rpy:5444
translate spanish story_e03ab93f:

    # m "So...It really is you then? Not Meiji?"
    m "Así que... de verdad eres tú, ¿no? ¿No Meiji?"

# game/story.rpy:5445
translate spanish story_52927674:

    # mc "And here I thought I was being obvious."
    mc "Y yo que pensaba que era bastante obvio."

# game/story.rpy:5447
translate spanish story_caf68aeb:

    # "I slide my poem towards her."
    "Deslizo mi poema hacia ella."

# game/story.rpy:5448
translate spanish story_ba7bbafe:

    # mc "I'm not known for my subtlety. I'm the player. Also, Meiji is just as much here as I am."
    mc "No soy conocido por mi sutileza. Soy el jugador. Además, Meiji está aquí tanto como yo."

# game/story.rpy:5449
translate spanish story_4bb91995:

    # m 3d "Wait...he is?"
    m 3d "Espera... ¿que sí lo está?"

# game/story.rpy:5450
translate spanish story_24c3d861:

    # mc "We'll discuss it later. Are you free after the club meeting is over?"
    mc "Lo hablaremos luego. ¿Estás libre cuando termine la reunión del club?"

# game/story.rpy:5451
translate spanish story_135379bd:

    # m 8h "I am."
    m 8h "Sí."

# game/story.rpy:5452
translate spanish story_f3c2d958:

    # mc "Good. Come by Meiji's place later tonight and we can talk. Just be careful. I don't want Sayori seeing."
    mc "Bien. Pasa por la casa de Meiji más tarde esta noche y podemos hablar. Solo ten cuidado. No quiero que Sayori vea."

# game/story.rpy:5456
translate spanish story_277c4a12:

    # m 1 "Alright then."
    m 1 "Vale."

# game/story.rpy:5460
translate spanish story_36d85180:

    # "She takes my poem and begins reading it."
    "Coge mi poema y empieza a leerlo."

# game/story.rpy:5462
translate spanish story_168118a8:

    # m "This...is long."
    m "Este es largo..."

# game/story.rpy:5463
translate spanish story_cc8fedbc_1:

    # mc "Sorry about that."
    mc "Perdona si te molesta."

# game/story.rpy:5464
translate spanish story_05bc74fa:

    # m 4j "That's okay. More for me to enjoy."
    m 4j "No te preocupes. Así hay más para disfrutar."

# game/story.rpy:5465
translate spanish story_7b471f6f:

    # mc "Good."
    mc "Vale."

# game/story.rpy:5468
translate spanish story_10a42d41:

    # "I take a look at Monika's poem."
    "Echo un vistazo al poema."

# game/story.rpy:5470
translate spanish story_4c28984a:

    # "What the..."
    "¿Pero qué...?"

# game/story.rpy:5471
translate spanish story_ae6d2167:

    # "This poem...it isn't the poem I remember."
    "Este poema... no es el que recuerdo."

# game/story.rpy:5472
translate spanish story_3ee58817:

    # cm "{i}[fname]...are you okay?{/i}"
    cm "{i}[fname]... ¿estás bien?{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:5473
translate spanish story_95ef52bb:

    # mc "{b}No, I'm not okay. How could I be? I just-Damn it!{/b}"
    mc "{b}No, no estoy bien. ¿Cómo iba a estarlo? Acabo de... ¡Mierda!{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:5474
translate spanish story_66cc8c27:

    # "I almost drop the poem in shock."
    "Casi suelto el poema de la impresión."

# game/story.rpy:5475
translate spanish story_f7d07207:

    # "I think I know how much she knows now."
    "Creo que ahora sé cuánto sabe."

# game/story.rpy:5476
translate spanish story_e5afc0c6:

    # "She's pre Act 3 Monika."
    "Es Monika pre-Acto 3."

# game/story.rpy:5477
translate spanish story_faff123b:

    # "This isn't gonna be easy."
    "Esto no va a ser fácil."

# game/story.rpy:5478
translate spanish story_d2928221:

    # "I read and reread her poem multiple times then close the book and clasp my hands, looking as calm as I can."
    "Leo y releo su poema varias veces, luego cierro el cuaderno y entrelazo las manos, intentando parecer lo más calmado posible."

# game/story.rpy:5480
translate spanish story_9f42d4b5:

    # "Monika's rereading my poem, mouthing the words."
    "Monika está releyendo mi poema, pronunciando las palabras en silencio."

# game/story.rpy:5481
translate spanish story_1a9bce42:

    # "It's like she's savoring them."
    "Es como si las estuviera saboreando."

# game/story.rpy:5482
translate spanish story_7ab733c7:

    # "When she's finished she puts the poem down."
    "Cuando termina, deja el poema."

# game/story.rpy:5483
translate spanish story_bdf69663:

    # m 1zh "That...was a sad story."
    m 1zh "Es... una historia triste."

# game/story.rpy:5484
translate spanish story_8745ba7c:

    # "She wipes her eyes."
    "Se limpia los ojos."

# game/story.rpy:5485
translate spanish story_4ebec00f:

    # m 2zi "Ah, I'm sorry. I just wasn't expecting this kind of poem from you. And that's not an insult! I mean I wasn't expecting a story-based poem."
    m 2zi "Ah, perdona. Es que no esperaba este tipo de poema de ti. ¡Sin ofender! Quiero decir que no esperaba un poema basado en una historia."

# game/story.rpy:5487
translate spanish story_83495ed0:

    # mc "I understand."
    mc "Ya."

# game/story.rpy:5488
translate spanish story_0766c65c:

    # mc "I wanted a poem that appealed in some small way to everyone, including you."
    mc "Quería un poema que conectara de alguna forma con todas, incluida tú."

# game/story.rpy:5489
translate spanish story_8e4a322f:

    # m 1k "Ahaha, yes, this is definitely something I really like."
    m 1k "Ja, ja, ja, sí, esto es algo que me gusta muchísimo."

# game/story.rpy:5490
translate spanish story_e165278b:

    # m 11zi "Can...I keep this?"
    m 11zi "¿Puedo quedarme con este...?"

# game/story.rpy:5492
translate spanish story_4396beba:

    # "Hard to believe someone so beautiful and cute causes so much pain."
    "Difícil de creer que alguien tan guapa y mona cause tanto dolor."

# game/story.rpy:5493
translate spanish story_64b603be:

    # mc "After I'm done showing it to the others, yes."
    mc "Claro, después de enseñárselo a las demás"

# game/story.rpy:5494
translate spanish story_86829734:

    # m 12b "Right, of course. What do you think of mine?"
    m 12b "Genial. ¿Qué te parece el mío?"

# game/story.rpy:5496
translate spanish story_de1c862f:

    # mc "I really enjoyed it. And don't go telling me about freeform style, because I've heard it before."
    mc "Me ha gustado, tiene tu toque. Y no me vayas a hablar del estilo libre, porque ya lo he oído antes."

# game/story.rpy:5498
translate spanish story_fb52676c:

    # "Wow, she was never this nervous in the game."
    "Vaya, en el juego nunca era tan nerviosa."

# game/story.rpy:5499
translate spanish story_385b0680:

    # mc "But in all honesty, it's so sad when you know exactly what it means."
    mc "Pero, a decir verdad, es tan triste cuando sabes exactamente lo que significa."

# game/story.rpy:5501
translate spanish story_08a02a93:

    # "I lean in closer again."
    "Me vuelvo a acercar un poco."
